WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.034
Mr. Secretary general.

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.702
I appreciate your time.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.536
I want to start with something

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:03.903
that I think

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.238
everybody was observing yesterday,

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.272
and that was the Victory Day

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.941
Parade in Moscow.

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:09.476
There's a lot of attention paid to

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.378
just how scaled down it was.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:15.248
Did you read anything in what we all saw?

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:18.485
Is there something to take away from that

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:20.754
I think we all should be

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:22.756
careful reading too much

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.824
into a scaled down parade.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.159
But anyway, it reflects

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.828
the fact that Russia has

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:31.931
lost a lot of capabilities in the war

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.733
against Ukraine.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.235
We have to remember that this was a war

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.369
that President Putin

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.238
planned to win within days

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:41.574
and now they have been in Ukraine

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.010
for 15 months and they have suffered

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.879
heavy casualties.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.448
And and this just demonstrates

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:50.550
the big strategic mistake

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.052
it was by President Putin

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.420
to to launch this

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.988
a war of aggression against Ukraine.

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.656
You mentioned the length of the war,

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:57.590
the expectations

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.026
at the very start of the invasion,

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:00.960
the durability

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.829
and the ability for Ukraine

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.230
to succeed up to this point

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.131
or to push back

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:05.999
throughout the course of the last

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.567
15 months, I think is astonished

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.302
most people, if not everyone.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.703
However, Ukrainian officials

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.272
have voiced some concern

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.706
that the expectations may be a little bit

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.008
too high for the counter

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:15.875
offensive concern

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.243
tied to
the fact that if there aren't

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.678
some sweeping victories

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.113
or significant

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.148
pushes, that the alliance

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.017
that has held together remarkably

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:25.351
well over the course of 15

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:26.086
months supporting

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.054
Ukraine may start to wither,

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:29.923
may start to fracture a little bit.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:30.824
What's your read on that?

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.061
President Putin made at

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:37.497
least two big mistakes

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:38.798
when he invaded Ukraine.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.867
One was to total underestimate

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.035
the Ukrainian

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:43.203
Ukraine armed forces,

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:44.070
the Ukrainian leadership,

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.872
President Zelensky.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.841
But they also told the underestimated

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.409
NATO and its allies

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:50.543
and not least the U.S.

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:51.311
leadership

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:52.412
that has been demonstrated

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.880
since the invasion

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.581
and where in its

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:58.218
allies has provided unprecedented

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.920
support to Ukraine

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.156
and when its allies and partners have

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:04.224
reiterated again

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:04.657
and again

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.359
that we will stand by Ukraine

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:07.393
for as long as it takes.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:08.761
And this is just demonstrated

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:09.829
this week

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:10.797
with the new announcement

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.799
from the United States

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:16.102
more than $1 billion in military aid.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:17.670
And, of course,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.707
wars are by nature, unpredictable.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.342
But what we have seen

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.042
is that

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.144
the Ukrainians have been able

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:26.446
to retake territory

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.882
before earlier in this war in the north,

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.650
in Kiev, in the eastern in Kharkiv

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.952
and in the south, again, around Kherson.

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.855
And and all the equipment,

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.157
all the training

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.324
they have received from NATO's

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.792
allies and partners,

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:43.163
including a nine brigades trained

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.631
and well equipped.

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:45.131
All of this

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:45.865
should enable them

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.567
to retake more territory

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.202
in their counter-offensive.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:49.903
At the same time,

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:51.337
we should never underestimate

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.372
the Russians

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:53.406
The front lines

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:55.208
have been static for a long time.

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.976
And the Russians have been able to build

00:02:58.077 --> 00:03:00.180
significant defensive lines

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.814
with minefields and

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:02.782
and under

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:04.817
and trenches to

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:06.653
to, of course, counter to the planned

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:07.687
the counteroffensive.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:08.922
You know,
you mentioned the durability

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:09.756
of the alliance

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:10.990
has probably gotten stronger

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.426
and actually larger by at least one

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:15.495
it since the invasion.

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:17.263
But there's another nation, Sweden,

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:19.432
that is also in line to join.

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:20.733
Do you believe Sweden,

00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:21.935
which is facing some issues

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:23.303
with at least one member country,

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:24.304
possibly, too,

00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:27.207
will be part of the alliance by July

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:29.609
during the NATO's summit

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:32.445
I'm absolutely confident that

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.380
Sweden will become a member.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.949
I will work hard to ensure that

00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:37.450
that will happen

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:40.119
by the summit.

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:43.022
In Vilnius in July this year.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.159
And we have to remember that regardless

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:46.593
of whether

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:47.527
when that happens,

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:50.563
that they will be a full member Sweden

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:51.931
is in a much better position

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:54.200
now than before they applied because

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.136
all allies, also Turkey invited

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:59.205
Sweden to become a member afterwards.

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:00.840
Summit last year in Madrid.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.008
And since then, Sweden

00:04:02.008 --> 00:04:04.043
has had the special status

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:04.811
and invite,

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:05.612
meaning that Sweden

00:04:05.612 --> 00:04:07.146
is participating

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:08.915
in NATO meetings, structures

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:09.849
integrating more

00:04:09.849 --> 00:04:10.950
and more into our civilian

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.352
and military structures.

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:13.953
So while I think United States

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:17.190
have issued bilateral security assurances

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:18.658
with Finland

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:19.759
in, if you look at the map,

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:20.760
you know, Sweden is now

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.528
surrounded by NATO countries.

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:24.998
So it's absolutely inconceivable

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:26.633
that there would be any

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:28.801
attack or a threat against Sweden

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:30.837
without NATO reacting. So.

00:04:31.137 --> 00:04:34.140
So so we have got a long way already

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.808
and I hope that we can finalized

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:37.243
accession process

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:38.511
by Vilnius

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:40.580
and let me just add that this isn't

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.815
actually a third big strategic mistake

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:44.250
that President Putin made.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.752
He invaded Ukraine

00:04:45.752 --> 00:04:47.820
and sent a clear message that he does

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.122
doesn't want more NATO

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:50.223
on this borders.

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:51.724
He's getting the exact opposite

00:04:51.724 --> 00:04:53.393
is getting more NATO presence in eastern

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:54.560
part of the alliance.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.696
And then he's getting two new members,

00:04:56.729 --> 00:04:58.564
Finland and Sweden, and with Finland,

00:04:58.564 --> 00:04:59.932
NATO's border

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:01.701
with Russia, more than doubles.

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:02.669
Yeah, it's a dramatic shift.

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:03.936
I do want to ask you before I let you go.

00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:05.571
We're learning this morning

00:05:05.571 --> 00:05:06.406
that talks are underway

00:05:06.406 --> 00:05:10.143
between Naito and Japan to open

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:12.679
a liaison office in the country,

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:14.514
I think would be the first in Asia.

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:15.181
Can you confirm

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:16.015
those talks are happening

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:17.016
with the strategy behind them?

00:05:19.185 --> 00:05:21.154
Yes, we are

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:25.091
talking with Japan about opening

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:27.293
an eight office in Tokyo,

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:29.262
and Naito has several offices

00:05:29.262 --> 00:05:30.229
in partner countries.

00:05:30.229 --> 00:05:31.998
And Japan is a

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:32.598
very close

00:05:32.598 --> 00:05:35.234
and important partner for for Naito

00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:39.372
and we agreed at the Naito Summit

00:05:39.372 --> 00:05:40.373
last year

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:42.475
that we should step up our partnership

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:44.610
with our Indo-Pacific partners

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.945
Australia, New Zealand,

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:47.647
Japan, and South Korea.

00:05:47.647 --> 00:05:49.382
I recently visited Japan

00:05:49.382 --> 00:05:51.617
and the message shared was that

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:54.721
security is not regional anymore.

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:55.722
Security is global.

00:05:55.722 --> 00:05:59.058
What happens in Europe matters for Asia

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:01.094
and what happens in Asia matters

00:06:01.094 --> 00:06:02.595
for for Europe.

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:04.497
And Beijing is watching closely

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:06.833
what happens in Ukraine

00:06:07.467 --> 00:06:09.202
The prize President Putin is paying.

00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:10.903
But those are the potential rewards.

00:06:10.903 --> 00:06:12.271
So what happens in Ukraine?

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:12.572
Actually,

00:06:12.572 --> 00:06:14.507
it matters for the calculations

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:16.743
that Beijing, China is making regarding,

00:06:16.743 --> 00:06:18.344
for instance, Taiwan.

00:06:19.379 --> 00:06:20.113
NATO's secretary

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:21.214
general, Jens Stoltenberg.

00:06:21.214 --> 00:06:21.914
Thanks so much, sir.

